    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ele<strong>MENTAL</strong> is a strategic, grid-based <strong>puzzle game</strong> where planning ahead is key. Merge and mix elements to trigger reactions and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198460/extras/7b097ed6158d8ec4a6d7caedde206378.poster.avif?t=1734144758\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198460/extras/7b097ed6158d8ec4a6d7caedde206378.webm?t=1734144758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198460/extras/7b097ed6158d8ec4a6d7caedde206378.mp4?t=1734144758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Unique Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mechanics in ele<strong>MENTAL</strong> may seem simple on the surface level. However, with each new mechanic building off of and intertwining with old mechanics, puzzles get complicated and interesting super quickly. To Complete the game you'll need to master these mechanics and challenge yourself to think about the mechanics in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198460/extras/c6feb5f178cde8621693c4944f5d290d.poster.avif?t=1734144758\" width=640 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198460/extras/c6feb5f178cde8621693c4944f5d290d.webm?t=1734144758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198460/extras/c6feb5f178cde8621693c4944f5d290d.mp4?t=1734144758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tons of Content:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the many puzzles in ele<strong>MENTAL</strong> are unique, bring something new, and build on the game mechanics. This causes the puzzles and secrets to feel interesting, with them all coming together to make a complete puzzle experience. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ele<strong>MENTAL</strong> is a strategic, grid-based <strong>puzzle game</strong> where planning ahead is key. Merge and mix elements to trigger reactions and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198460/extras/7b097ed6158d8ec4a6d7caedde206378.poster.avif?t=1734144758\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198460/extras/7b097ed6158d8ec4a6d7caedde206378.webm?t=1734144758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198460/extras/7b097ed6158d8ec4a6d7caedde206378.mp4?t=1734144758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Unique Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mechanics in ele<strong>MENTAL</strong> may seem simple on the surface level. However, with each new mechanic building off of and intertwining with old mechanics, puzzles get complicated and interesting super quickly. To Complete the game you'll need to master these mechanics and challenge yourself to think about the mechanics in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198460/extras/c6feb5f178cde8621693c4944f5d290d.poster.avif?t=1734144758\" width=640 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198460/extras/c6feb5f178cde8621693c4944f5d290d.webm?t=1734144758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198460/extras/c6feb5f178cde8621693c4944f5d290d.mp4?t=1734144758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tons of Content:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the many puzzles in ele<strong>MENTAL</strong> are unique, bring something new, and build on the game mechanics. This causes the puzzles and secrets to feel interesting, with them all coming together to make a complete puzzle experience. </p>",
